            <div xml:id="d1177">

                <pb facs="0960" n="844" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg844"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/6946.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Belt to
                        the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Saltillo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-11-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 20, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s November 19. Silliman accompanied Chief Executive to Monterey.
                    Foreign Secretary this morning advised me he would at once telegraph and order
                    proper authorities to station guard at Los Mochis to protect American lives and
                    property.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">John W. Belt.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
